<title>USA: Atlanta Fed index 17.5 in June vs 17.3 in May.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed index 17.5 in June vs 17.3 in May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said on Monday its index of industry business activity rose to 17.5 in June from a revised 17.3 in May.</p>
<p>					 June		    May</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	  17.5		   17.3-R</p>
<p>Production Index		   15.2		   12.7-R</p>
<p>Prices Received		     1.0		   -4.4-R</p>
<p>Prices Paid			   8.7		   11.0-R</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		  -2.3		    3.5-R</p>
<p>New Orders			    8.5		    8.8-R</p>
<p>Shipments			    11.1		   15.4-R</p>
<p>Number of Employees		 7.1		    3.1-R</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods  -0.5		   -1.4-R</p>
<p>Materials Inventories	     1.3		   -3.5-R</p>
<p>Supplier Delivery Time	    1.1		    2.9-R</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
